    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/ba787d07c2d32ef4ca1980e3e176466e.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/fb49b26bb084dd0c7b4990b9ed743ed4.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=260 /></span><strong>BAA! Never Stop Bleating</strong> offers a thrilling roguelike experience where sheep must construct sturdy homes in the wilderness and quickly repair any damage after beastly attacks to protect their babies from harm. Inspired by the classic tale of &quot;The Three Little Pigs,&quot; the game challenges players to strategize resource management and respond swiftly to threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/d14b9cc1700e867a0f950a929ff6387f.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/b3070e5bc181661a2140a10c727de9e4.poster.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/b3070e5bc181661a2140a10c727de9e4.webm?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/b3070e5bc181661a2140a10c727de9e4.mp4?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather resources, craft building materials, and construct walls. Combine various construction equipment to create a home that can withstand any attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/5bb0d505476a1108afc89587a844a314.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/e742e6f7392bfd5f0382f54e9df9b557.poster.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/e742e6f7392bfd5f0382f54e9df9b557.webm?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/e742e6f7392bfd5f0382f54e9df9b557.mp4?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Building a sturdy home in the dark forest, fending off terrifying beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/1761dcbf877c142bb515c293dc79876c.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/9cf0eb59d517704b824ece2333d8e870.poster.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/9cf0eb59d517704b824ece2333d8e870.webm?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/9cf0eb59d517704b824ece2333d8e870.mp4?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Here are various little lamb buddies that can help you build a sturdy home more quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/6f4b0519c1d7e386fa3e1ad1c507005c.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/4fe5c86be040a33857be625647750b52.poster.avif?t=1740878864\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/4fe5c86be040a33857be625647750b52.webm?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821880/extras/4fe5c86be040a33857be625647750b52.mp4?t=1740878864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Brave the challenges alone or team up with friends to defend the sheep together. Supports local gameplay for 1-2 players and online gameplay for 1-4 devices simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
